&lt;img alt="" class="lazyload" data-alt="概念店以寧靜之境為設計理念" data-link="" data-src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4075000/4076377/store_1_1200.jpg" src="https://static04.hket.com/res/v3/image/content/4075000/4076377/store_1_1200.jpg" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;"/&gt;
